"2\">YANG DI-PERTUAN NEGARA'S SPEECH</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">Title:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">YANG DI-PERTUAN NEGARA'S SPEECH (Debate on the Address)</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n<tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font size=\"2\">MPs Speaking:</font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font size=\"2\">Mr Lee Kuan Yew (Prime Minister); Mr A. P. Rajah; Mr Ong Eng Guan; Tun Lim Yew Hock; Sir George Oehlers (Mr Speaker);</font></td></tr>\r\n\r\n</table></td></tr>\r\n\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<font size=\"1\"><b>Column: 601</b></font><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br><!-- Mr Lee Kuan Yew (The Prime Minister) -->&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<b>The Prime Minister:</b> Division, Sir.\r\n\r\nThe House divided: Ayes, 35; Noes, 5; Abstentions, Nil; Absent, 11.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n       Ayes.               Noes.\r\n\r\n Ahmad bin Ibrahim.  Abdul Hamid bin\r\n\r\n Baharuddin bin       Haji Jumat.\r\n\r\n  Mohamed Ariff.     Lim Yew Hock.\r\n\r\n Bani, S. T.         Mohd. Ali bin\r\n\r\n Buang bin Omar       Alwi.\r\n\r\n  Junid.             Rajab, A. P.\r\n\r\n Byrne, K. M,        Thio Chan Bee.\r\n\r\n Chan Chee Seng.         \r\n\r\n Chan Choy Siong,     Abstentions.\r\n\r\n  Miss.                   Nil.\r\n\r\n Chan Sun Wing.       \r\n\r\n Chor Yeok Eng.          Absent.\r\n\r\n Goh Chew Chua.      \r\n\r\n Hoe Puay Choo,     Ahmad Jabri bin\r\n\r\n  Madam.             Mohammad Akib.\r\n\r\n Kandasamy, G.      Fung Yin Ching.\r\n\r\n Lee Khoon Choy.     Miss.\r\n\r\n Lee Kuan Yew.      Goh Keng Swee.\r\n\r\n Lee Siew Choh.     Koh, C. H.\r\n\r\n Leong Keng Seng.   Lee Teck Him.\r\n\r\n Lin You Eng.       Lim Cheng Lock.\r\n\r\n Lingam, S. V.      Ng Teng Kian.\r\n\r\n Low Por Tuck.      Seow Peck Leng,\r\n\r\n Maminen, John.      Mrs.\r\n\r\n Mohd. Ariff bin    Tan Kia Gan.\r\n\r\n  Suradi.           Toh Chin Chye.\r\n\r\n M. Ismail Rahim.   Yong Nyuk Lin.\r\n\r\n Ong Chang Sam.     \r\n\r\n Ong Eng Guan.\r\n\r\n Ong Pang Boon.\r\n\r\n Rajaratnam, S.\r\n\r\n Ramaswamy, S.\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br><font size=\"1\"><b>Column: 602</b></font><br><br>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n\r\n        Ayes.\r\n\r\n Sahorah binte Ahmat,\r\n\r\n  Madam.\r\n\r\n Sheng Nam Chin.\r\n\r\n Tan Cheng Tong.\r\n\r\n Tee Kim Leng.\r\n\r\n Teo Hock Guan.\r\n\r\n Wee Toon Boon.\r\n\r\n Wong Soon Fong.\r\n\r\n Yaacoh bin Mohamed.\r\n\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Motion accordingly agreed to.\r\n\r\n\n</body></html>",
